  "description": "HUZMOF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C98 H71 Cl3 Dy4 O14 S8,4.66(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.529-5.033 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.64-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ4-OH)(PTC4A)2Cl3(CH3OH)2(H2O)3]·4.7CH3OH·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
